    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様。事務所に行ってたんだな",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……\r\nプロデューサーさまは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、今から事務所だ\r\nなんだ、まっすぐ寮には帰らないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110080,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……\r\n何となく……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……『なにとなく　君に待たるる　ここちして\r\n出でし花野の　夕月夜かな』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110090,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "──ぷ、プロデューサーさま……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──え、いや……\r\nその歌のこと、ちょうど思い出しててさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだ、この前の収録、すごくよかったぞ！\r\n『聴きたい日本文学』、俺も勉強になったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110100,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それは……\r\nお喜びいただけたなら……幸いです……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その歌、ロマンチックだよなぁ\r\n『月が自分を待ってくれてる』なんてさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110110,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "…………プロデューサーさま……\r\nふふっ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110120,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それも……\r\n素敵な読みでございます……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれっ、そういう意味じゃないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110130,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "『貴方が……待ってくれている……\r\nなんとなく……そのような気がして……』",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110140,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "『たまらずに……飛び出してみると……\r\n花野に月が……照っていた……』",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110150,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……片恋のようにも見える……\r\n相聞の歌でございます……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110160,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "確かに……\r\n『君』が『月』だと……読むこともできましょう……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああー！　『好きな人が待ってる気がする』ってことか！\r\nリズムがいいから、覚えてたんだけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっき、その収録の音源届いてたみたいだから、\r\nチェックしとくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110170,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……\r\nありがとうございます……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──不思議なもんだよな。あの時聞いただけなのに、\r\nなんとなく耳に残っちゃってるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110180,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ふふ……\r\n言葉とは……強いもの……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110190,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "想いは……\r\nそれに乗って……時を超えるのでしょう……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110200,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は……\r\nこの詠み人の心……他人事とは思えません……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら音源チェック、\r\n一緒にできたらいいんだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110210,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "では……\r\n一緒に……参りましょう……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、凛世\r\n引き返すことになっちゃうぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012008110220,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ……\r\nよいのです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200811/2012008110220"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textFrame": "off",
